WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.370
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:10.530
I'm Corey Cleveland,
currently a senior.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.990
I study electrical
engineering, and I

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.850
am the captain of the
ballroom dance team this year.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.637
I started off when
I was a freshman.

00:00:19.637 --> 00:00:20.970
And it was completely new to me.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.178
I had never done any dancing.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.022
I just saw them like
flying across the floor.

00:00:34.022 --> 00:00:35.730
You know it was hard
not to get infected.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:38.063
And I was like, I want to be
able to do this and present

00:00:38.063 --> 00:00:38.870
this myself.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.790
As well as give this
to other people.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.285
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:20.520
It's amazing because humans have
like this small imperceptible

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.830
ability to pick up on each
other's body language.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.140
And so I can talk to
the audience that way.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.710
Even more so, I
have an opportunity

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.380
to communicate with my partner.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.140
And there's this like such an
intimate and deep connection

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:32.280
with another person.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.970
That's really what I enjoy.

